{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"21":"The Book of Funerals"},"section_detail":{"21":{"hadithnumber_first":1818,"hadithnumber_last":2089,"arabicnumber_first":1818,"arabicnumber_last":2089,"name_native":"The Book of Funerals"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1916,"arabicnumber":1916,"text":"It was narrated form 'Amir bin Rabi'ah Al-'Adawi that the Messenger of Allah said:\"When you see a funeral, stand up until it has passed you, or (the body) is placed (in the grave)","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":99}}]}